# Sort By with a key lambda, then Take Item 0 — the optimizer fuses the pair
# into a selection of the single largest key, with no sort at all.
Cursed Energy: stdin
Cursed Technique: Split Text by "\n"
Cursed Technique: Match Pattern
    Using: "{a:int}-{b:int}"
Domain Expansion: Sort By, Descending
    Using: (r) -> r.b
Cursed Technique: Take Item 0
Cursed Technique: Apply
    Using: (r) -> r.a
Reveal: stdout
